WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.755
I've been unlucky.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.758
I mean, it's been really bad of late.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.344
I see it.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.763
What's that?

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:19.102
It seems something evil
is attached to you.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.272
Not just one, but three.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.357
If you don't get rid of them...

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.446
you'll never be able to get married.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:34.325
There's something
that can improve your fortune.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:42.792
Life is like a deep ocean.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:44.961
Once you've lost your way,

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:48.715
it won't be easy to get out.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.552
To find your way out,

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:57.474
this rosary can help.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.399
Hi, guys.

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.124
What?

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:26.836
Snacks?

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:31.216
Sorry, no snacks today.

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.345
All right then.

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:38.598
Since you're so mad at me,

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.684
you can go and live with Tokio.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.860
Who is it?

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:56.699
What's up? Running away from home?

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:02.372
I'd love to let you stay here,

00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:06.209
but I'm sorry,
my mom is allergic to bears.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.711
Bear fur makes her nose itch.

00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:10.964
Sorry, guys.

